  "chapter.kingdomsatwar.seal.card": "The seal is broken. The gate stands open.",
  "chronicle.kingdomsatwar.chronicle.text": "This chronicle was written by the keepers of the seal, generation after generation. It tells of a circle of six monoliths not far from the heart of the world: the Seal Circle. It was there that the seal was once forged.\n\nSeek out the circle. The pages themselves will show you the way.",
  "chronicle.kingdomsatwar.circle.distance": "The Seal Circle lies about %s blocks to the %s.",
  "chronicle.kingdomsatwar.circle.here": "You are standing in the Seal Circle.",
  "chronicle.kingdomsatwar.circle.unknown": "Only in the Overworld can the chronicle show you the way to the Seal Circle.",
  "chronicle.kingdomsatwar.crown.text": "The land has seen a hero who defeated dragons and passed through the gate of shadows. Only one thing remains: the crown.\n\nReturn home to your kingdom. Your people are waiting for you.",
  "chronicle.kingdomsatwar.dragon.awake": "Has awakened!",
  "chronicle.kingdomsatwar.dragon.defeated": "Defeated – its shard belongs in the Seal Circle.",
  "chronicle.kingdomsatwar.dragon.inserted": "Defeated – its shard rests in the monolith.",
  "chronicle.kingdomsatwar.dragon.rumor": "It %s, %s.",
  "chronicle.kingdomsatwar.dragon.sleeps": "Sleeps in %s, %s.",
  "chronicle.kingdomsatwar.dragons.text": "At the Seal Circle, a monolith awaits the shard of each dragon. The dragons slumber in their lairs, each in its own land. None of them can be defeated alone – bring your army. The dragon compass will show you the way.\n\nWhen a dragon falls, its egg and its seal shard remain. Bring the shard to its monolith.",
  "chronicle.kingdomsatwar.gate.distance": "The Shadow Gate lies about %s blocks to the %s, in the heart of the Seal Circle.",
  "chronicle.kingdomsatwar.gate.here": "The Shadow Gate lies right before you.",
  "chronicle.kingdomsatwar.gate.unknown": "The Shadow Gate lies in the heart of the Seal Circle.",
  "chronicle.kingdomsatwar.goal.crown": "Be crowned in your throne room",
  "chronicle.kingdomsatwar.goal.defeat": "Defeat the six dragons (%s/6)",
  "chronicle.kingdomsatwar.goal.enter_shadow": "Step through the Shadow Gate",
  "chronicle.kingdomsatwar.goal.find_circle": "Find the Seal Circle",
  "chronicle.kingdomsatwar.goal.insert": "Place the seal shards in their monoliths (%s/6)",
  "chronicle.kingdomsatwar.goal.read": "Read the chronicle",
  "chronicle.kingdomsatwar.goal.recruit": "Recruit your first soldier",
  "chronicle.kingdomsatwar.goal.table": "Set up a recruitment table",
  "chronicle.kingdomsatwar.goals": "Goals",
  "chronicle.kingdomsatwar.kingdom.text": "You have arrived in a foreign land with little more than the clothes on your back. Yet this land is waiting for someone to unite it.\n\nBuild a home, gather supplies and find people who will follow you. Every army begins at a recruitment table.",
  "chronicle.kingdomsatwar.prolog.text": "When the world was young, the Shadow World broke forth from the depths. Six elemental dragons – fire, ice, lightning, nature, earth and water – stood against it and locked it away behind a seal. Ever since, each of them has carried a sixth of that seal in its heart.\n\nBut the burden changed them. Over the centuries the guardians themselves grew wild, and today they suffer no one near their lairs.",
  "chronicle.kingdomsatwar.seal.broken": "The seal is broken",
  "chronicle.kingdomsatwar.seal.count": "%s of 6 shards in place",
  "chronicle.kingdomsatwar.seal.text": "When the last shard came to rest in its monolith, the seal shattered. What the dragons kept locked away for an age now lies open: at the heart of the circle yawns the gate to the Shadow World.\n\nNo one knows what awaits you on the other side.",
  "chronicle.kingdomsatwar.where.exact": "about %s blocks to the %s",
